@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}
@jwtToken = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}
@adminToken = {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### ── Member: voucher wallet (plan 20) ─────────────────────────────────────

### My wallet: every voucher with state active / used / expired
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Wallet checked against my cart: discount or problem per voucher
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/for-cart
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Check a typed code against my cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/quote?code=HOCVUI
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Put a code into my wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/add
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "HOCVUI"}

### Vouchers to collect at a place (public; home, search, pdp, partner, fun, tier)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/collectible?place=pdp&itemId=123

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/collectible?place=partner&partnerId=45

### Collect one (one per person per group)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vouchers/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"groupId": 1}

### Checkout with a wallet voucher (or "couponCode" for a typed code) and anyPoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paymentMethod": "bank_transfer", "voucherId": 10, "pointsUsed": 30}

### ── Admin ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### New dynamic group limited to two courses, collectible on the home page and the course page
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Giảm 50.000đ khóa bơi", "type": "money", "generateType": "auto", "prefix": "BOI", "length": 6, "qtt": 200,
 "value": 50000, "ruleMin": 500000, "status": true, "collectible": true, "walletDays": 30,
 "showOn": ["home", "pdp"], "itemIds": [123, 124]}

### Static code with 100 uses until a date
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/groups/1/codes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "HOCVUI", "uses": 100, "expiredAt": "2026-12-31"}

### Give one voucher of a group to some phones
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/groups/1/grant
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phones": "0901234567, 0912345678"}

### Events (types: register, first_order, buy_item, follow_partner, buy_partner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Partner event: following partner 45 gives group 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "follow_partner", "title": "Theo dõi trường ABC tặng 30k", "partnerId": 45, "groupIds": [2], "qtt": 1, "status": true}

### Wallet of a member, report
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/wallet?who=0901234567
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers/report?months=6
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
